  "description": "Non-material amendments to planning permission reference 17/0233/FUL dated 10/01/18 for 'Redevelopment of site to provide a 6 storey building comprising 3,457sqm of Class A1 use (foodstore) at ground floor level and 96no. self-contained flats (Class C3) at first to fifth floor levels including basement car parking, cycle parking, refuse stores and a single storey car parking deck.' Amendments include 'to condition 2 (superseding drawings) of planning permission 17/0233/FUL and minor alteration of the description of development. Proposed amendments include changes to Asda Atrium and Entrance location, reconfiguration of windows and balconies, introduction of Ancillary space within the development, Materiality changes limited to the rear boundary elevation and residential elevation overlooking the service yard. Removal of conditions 7, 13, 14, 26, 27 and 32, and the associated elements of non-material amendment Variation of wording to condition 11, replacement of PV layout plan (approved condition 5), replacement of parking layout plan (approved condition 12) (AMENDED DESCRIPTION AND PLANS)",
